          "content": "<div><div><label for=''>地址：</label><span>虹口区北苏州路276号</span></div><div><label for=''>名称：</label><span>上海邮政大楼</span></div><div><label for=''>建成年代：</label><span>1924</span></div><div><label for=''>原建筑类型：</label><span>办公</span></div><div><label for=''>曾用途：</label><span>上海邮政总局</span></div><div><label for=''>现用途：</label><span>上海邮政博物馆</span></div></div>",
